5,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"Let's be smart about this. We need to find the werewolf fast, so if anyone has a lead, speak up. I'll be watching everyone closely.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe we should remain calm and observe each other's patterns before jumping to conclusions.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"Hi everyone! I'm so happy to be playing with you all! Let's just be honest and help each other out, okay? We can do this!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Hello. I agree with George. Rushing into accusations without evidence usually leads to mistakes. We should be cautious.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Rin,,Yay! This is like a real adventure! I'll follow whatever the grown-ups decide because you guys are way smarter than me!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Takumi,,Being too cautious just gives the werewolf more time to kill us. We need a strategy to flush them out early.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"While I understand your urgency, Takumi, a hasty execution of a villager is just as damaging as a night attack.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"Oh, let's not fight! I'm sure we can find a way to be both careful and quick. I trust you guys!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"If we are too open with our roles, the werewolf will just target the Seer immediately. Silence might be our best defense for now.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Rin,,"Ooh, a secret mission! I like that! Misaki-san sounds like she has a great plan, so I'm with her!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"Fine, we keep it quiet for a bit. But the moment I see a contradiction, I'm calling it out. Don't expect me to be soft.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,That is a fair approach. Logic and consistency will be our best tools in this game. I shall be observing.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"You're so cool and serious, Takumi-kun! But please be gentle with us! I'll do my best to help everyone stay safe!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,It's better to let the werewolf make the first mistake. We should focus on who is trying too hard to lead the group.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Rin,,"I'm not trying to lead, I'm just following! Takumi-kun is scary but cool, and Misaki-san is smart! I'll just watch you all!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not scary, I'm just focused! Let's get some sleep. I'll find the truth tonight.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,"I agree. Let us see what the first morning brings. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"Sweet dreams, everyone! I hope we all wake up tomorrow morning! Love you all!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Misaki,,Good night. Let's hope for a peaceful morning.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
25,0,4,talk,Rin,,Good night! I wonder who the werewolf is? It's so exciting! I'm going to sleep now!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
