32,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I've got a lead. George is human. Now, I want to see if anyone tries to lie about their role or contradicts that.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,George,,"@Takumi, you are claiming to be the Seer? It is a bold move to reveal yourself so early.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Wow, Takumi-kun is so brave! Thank you for protecting us! I feel so much safer knowing you're on our side!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Misaki,,Revealing yourself so quickly is risky. Are you sure you aren't the werewolf trying to gain trust by pretending to be the Seer?,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Rin,,"Takumi-kun is the Seer! He's so strong and confident, he must be telling the truth! I believe him!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, if I were the werewolf, I wouldn't clear George. I'm the Seer, and I'm going to lead us to victory.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,George,,"I appreciate the clearance, though I remain skeptical of the strategy. However, if Takumi is the Seer, we have a starting point.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Yumi,,See? George-san is being so polite! We're all such a great team. I just want us all to be happy and safe!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I'm just thinking logically. The werewolf often mimics the Seer to control the vote. We should be careful not to follow blindly.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Rin,,"But Misaki-san, Takumi-kun sounds so sure! I think we should just trust him and do what he says!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Misaki, your skepticism is starting to look like a cover. Why are you trying to sow doubt about the only person providing info?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,George,,"Let us not be hasty. Misaki's caution is a valid perspective. However, Takumi's confidence is consistent with his behavior yesterday.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Oh no, please don't argue! Misaki-san is just being careful because she cares about us too, right? Let's all just get along!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I'm not sowing doubt; I'm encouraging critical thinking. If we just follow one person, we are vulnerable to a lie.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Rin,,"I don't like it when people argue! Takumi-kun, please tell us who the bad guy is so we can stop fighting!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'll tell you who the bad guy is once I've checked more people. But for now, Misaki is the most suspicious.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,George,,"I have observed that Misaki is the only one resisting the current flow. While logical, it can also be a tactic of the Possessed.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"I really don't want to vote for anyone, but if Takumi-kun thinks so... I'll trust my friends! I'm so sorry, Misaki-san!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm just trying to protect the village from a potential trap. It's disappointing that you're turning on me for being cautious.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm sorry Misaki-san, but Takumi-kun is the leader! I'm voting with him! Let's find the werewolf!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
