65,2,1,talk,George,,"Takumi has been attacked. This is a devastating blow. If he was indeed the Seer, we have lost our eyes.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,2,1,talk,Yumi,,"Oh my goodness! Takumi-kun! No way! This is terrible! I'm so sad, I can't believe this is happening!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,2,1,talk,Rin,,Noooo! Takumi-kun is gone! Who would do such a mean thing?! I'm so scared now!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,2,2,talk,George,,"We must remain calm. The werewolf targeted the most vocal leader to create chaos. We are now left with Yumi, Rin, and myself.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"*sniffle* I'm so scared... what are we going to do? I just want us to be safe. George-san, please tell us what to do!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,2,talk,Rin,,"George-san is the smartest now! Please save us! I'll do whatever you say, just make the bad wolf go away!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,3,talk,George,,"I am a simple villager, but I can think. If Takumi was the Seer, the werewolf is among us. Yumi, you have been very emotional.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,3,talk,Yumi,,I'm just really upset! I liked Takumi-kun so much! How could you think I'm the werewolf when I'm crying?! That's so mean!,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,3,talk,Rin,,"Yumi-chan is too sweet to be a werewolf! She's just a crybaby! George-san, you're being too mean to her!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,4,talk,George,,"Emotion can be a mask, Rin. However, the werewolf needs to survive. If I vote for Yumi and I am wrong, the wolf wins.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,4,talk,Yumi,,I'll do anything to prove I'm a good person! I just want us to be friends! Please don't hate me!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't hate anyone! But I think George-san is the boss now, so I'll just wait and see what he decides!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
